type: software
title: "AMLPetriNet"
abstract: >-
  A plugin for the AutomationML Editor, a web application and a command line
  tool that model, simulate and analyse place/transition Petri nets in
  AutomationML documents, with PNML as the exchange format (ISO/IEC 15909-2).
authors:
